e + N2(j=0) -> e + N2(j=4). Song et al. JPCRD 2023 Table 6 (0.01-10 eV), held at the 10 eV value above; header 0.0049335 eV = 20 B_0, B_0 = 1.98958 cm^-1 (NIST WebBook, Huber & Herzberg). Gross loss from j = 0, no superelastic return (over-states net rotational cooling). Maxwellian-integrated by abep_sim/rate_tables.py (scripts/build_n2_rotational_tables.py). Reaction set abep-n2n-0.10.
